  "description": "Flow layout for Broadside: paragraphs broken into lines, aligned and justified, and flowed across pages of a set size and margins through the core's canvas API. A document builder describes documents as nested content in C# and lays them out through the flow engine. Depends only on the Broadside core and its Standard 14 font package. No native dependencies.",
